box-shadow and transform for AnkiNX (cards with shadows, rotated or scaled
elements): litehtml ignores both. The values are kept as written in the
computed style (get_box_shadow, get_transform, get_transform_origin) and the
document container draws them: draw_box_shadow before an element's
background; begin_transform/end_transform around each transformed element's
drawing and its descendants', in every drawing pass. The new container calls
have empty defaults. Layout ignores transforms, as in browsers; so does hit
testing (taps on a rotated element use its unrotated box).

